                                                                            <comments>
                            <comment id="502903" author="JIRAUSER19582" created="Tue, 6 Oct 2026 05:56:47 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hey &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=adilger&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;adilger&quot;&gt;adilger&lt;/a&gt;, this has been deployed to Maloo&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If a failure occurs while testing an LU ticket and is associated with that same ticket, Maloo will exclude it from the historical weighting used to match future failures in that subtest&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="502912" author="adilger" created="Tue, 6 Oct 2026 09:26:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Perfect, thank you for the update. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
